EXP4:-
👇

🔹 Core Idea

This program implements a Dictionary using AVL Tree.

Stores:
key → word
meaning → meaning
AVL Tree is a self-balancing Binary Search Tree

🔹 Key Advantage of AVL
BST                         AVL
May become skewed             Always balanced
Worst  O(n)                    O(log n)

🔹 In Short
👉 This program:
Stores dictionary words in AVL Tree
Automatically balances tree using rotations
Provides fast insert, search, and display operations.



EXP5:-
👇

🔹 Core Idea

This program implements an Employee Management System using Sequential File Handling.

Data is stored in a file → "employee.txt"
Records are handled sequentially (one by one)
🔹 Main Operations
Add Employee
Takes input
Appends data to file (ios::app)
Display All
Reads file from start
Prints all records
Search
Reads file sequentially
Matches ID
Update
Reads old file
Writes updated data to temp.txt
Replaces original file
Delete
Copies all records except the one to delete into temp.txt
Replaces original file
🔹 Key Logic
No direct editing in file
Uses temporary file method for update & delete
🔹 In Short

👉 This is a file-based CRUD system where:

Data is stored permanently in a file
Operations are done by reading and rewriting the file


